": "1649951459463035", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623443_1649951462796368_6495437171366118499_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5RzQmbLcmBUQ7kNvwHYjgzU&_nc_oc=AdqpvyWDwVaIboEFGsSvrUoOa8iLdg1tMuWXV8RNDR2xxU42Y3H-qEmzDOddD1Zz1uo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9kF0VRrNCO3wHXD1UZriApvWDLc0_AgMdaux768JqYQ&oe=6AFDE048"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot3.png", "id": "796010373336947", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_796010376670280_1622690528672245878_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nH5z-YeHQSgQ7kNvwHCKW5O&_nc_oc=AdrkVMVt8wX382H_wb9X6FaQlKP9MvIYUQEUX4hpj5SpF1C4JWpG7ITQM5jtZxnkAnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSRISqbQpbFdNVNux2itdSuEDrZ1l8m9xtM7DmM76US7A&oe=6AFDDB48"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot4.png", "id": "900207153052082", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_900207156385415_3810073691747307333_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GsPvITKW6dIQ7kNvwE71KHA&_nc_oc=Adpd2RMFnV6MhF3VdVWgFpJeXZg7QpcQdjazdYHhCjzsKVBFDA83TLM2PNU3AVTt8jk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS3OcNHAbtqee9jANdJS4fhMkCeZ7DUltPvwAVlT4hd3Q&oe=6AFDBA6F"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot5.png", "id": "947398901258988", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_947398904592321_4765479034696321724_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0TuDfsnMAmQQ7kNvwFA6SbF&_nc_oc=Adp3-pIeNOAcjeoxJif1kPGpHfy0GHOTBQk82N6n5lQVN8I3Me5VkQknJ8LfMSQh09g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT5GDfTbC9ETrEIYszmpeX-LnfQDmUVhZAmiyI1kkXr-w&oe=6AFDDB3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Snapshot_1.PNG", "id": "712382138600986", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_712382141934319_6039130477330376030_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2F6XOps-RrgQ7kNvwHZCAFG&_nc_oc=Adqj31b7a1H4ympe_SPYF1L7n3VoKC5dNDvy6tTznQXebBN2jN2k2XgGFNwKdA3NqvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRhmvvyXD_EzQNZ1HE1CrJxIruw3AN4aOcDd8mS97bNug&oe=6AFDDA85"}, "display_name": "The Abstract Art Gallery", "keywords": ["Abstract", "Art", "Gallery", "Neon", "Paintings"], "long_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944). He was one of the most important 20th-century artists. He was a major figure in modern art and painted some of the first modern abstract works.\n\nThe experience does not show the original paintings of Wassily Kandinsky, instead it presents a Neon-Futuristic version of each painting. You have a play button on each panting to see an AI Animation made with the Meta AI.\n\nThe exposition is divided in 6 sections (each section contains 10 paintings), and there is a transportation point to move from one section to another.\n\nKandinsky also developed a theory of geometric figures and their relationships, claiming (for example) that the circle is the most peaceful shape and represents the human soul.", "short_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-notice-last-updated-april-15_19.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-are-we-indie-virtual-reality-video.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "4349619